WEBVTT

00:05:58.854 --> 00:06:01.273
there were about two faces
that I could recognize.

00:06:01.315 --> 00:06:03.442
There was James and Patrick,

00:06:03.484 --> 00:06:06.612
two of the children
I had worked with the previous day.

00:06:07.238 --> 00:06:10.282
And with the most innocent faces
that I have ever seen,

00:06:10.324 --> 00:06:13.160
they were like, “Could you come
and join us at school,

00:06:13.202 --> 00:06:15.663
and then we play the game
before school starts?”

00:06:16.163 --> 00:06:19.333
And looking at their faces,
there was no way I was going to say no.

00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:21.961
I said, "I'll dress up
and meet you over by school."

00:06:22.503 --> 00:06:26.799
And this group of amazing children
became my early testers.

00:06:26.841 --> 00:06:28.676
We would play the game in the morning,

00:06:28.676 --> 00:06:32.346
and then in the afternoon, as they waited
for their afternoon shift.